  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>GatorBait Roundup: South Carolina Saturday, Buddy on the Balm of Homecoming</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Florida hosts South Carolina Saturday at 12:45 p.m. ET. Buddy Martin on the balm of Homecoming, Franz Beard on the explosive plays, Baugh owns it and more.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Newsreader" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,600;6..72,700&amp;display=swap" />
