        <mj-text align="center" padding="0"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=masthead" style="text-decoration:none;"><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:34px;color:#003B7A;">GATOR</span><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:34px;color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span></a><br/><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#6D7888;">ROUNDUP</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 24px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#5F6B7A" font-size="10px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.7px" padding="0">SOUTH CAROLINA GAME WEEK · OCTOBER 7, 2026</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="4px 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_52f12f29b57540dcb22edd0fa545ceb1~mv2.jpg" alt="Florida running back Jadan Baugh celebrates a touchdown with a teammate during the Ole Miss game. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/buddy-blog-florida-gators-need-the-balm-of-homecoming-this-week?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=buddy_lead" padding="0 0 12px" />
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Buddy Martin</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/buddy-blog-florida-gators-need-the-balm-of-homecoming-this-week?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=buddy_lead" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Buddy Blog: Florida Gators Need the Balm of Homecoming This Week</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Sumrall didn’t care about Mizzou’s homecoming, but he certainly does his own this week. Buddy Martin on Florida’s reset, Mac Steen and a lesson from 1990.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/buddy-blog-florida-gators-need-the-balm-of-homecoming-this-week?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=buddy_lead" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 26px 0">
      <mj-column><mj-text color="#081B35" font-size="20px" font-weight="800" padding="0 0 4px">THE STORIES</mj-text><mj-divider border-color="#FA4616" border-width="3px" padding="0" /></mj-column>
    </mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_49f61d2e3df04d09947775688b8de577~mv2.jpg" alt="Florida defensive lineman Oyebadejo (99) pressures Missouri quarterback Simmons. Photo: UAA Photo, UF Athletic Association." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/homecoming-test-no-16-florida-hosts-south-carolina-saturday-at-12-45-p-m?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=sc_preview" padding="0 0 12px" />
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Game Week</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/homecoming-test-no-16-florida-hosts-south-carolina-saturday-at-12-45-p-m?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=sc_preview" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Homecoming Test: No. 16 Florida Hosts South Carolina Saturday at 12:45 p.m.</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Florida (4-1) answers the 45-17 loss at Missouri against a South Carolina team (2-3) with the nation’s No. 7 rushing offense, per ESPN. Kickoff is 12:45 p.m. ET on SEC Network.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/homecoming-test-no-16-florida-hosts-south-carolina-saturday-at-12-45-p-m?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=sc_preview" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Franz Beard</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-october-7-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=franz_oct7" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Thoughts of the Day: October 7, 2026</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Franz Beard on Florida’s explosive-play problem, South Carolina, the SEC across the board, and the push to expand the College Football Playoff.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-october-7-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=franz_oct7" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Gator Football</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/baugh-owns-it-florida-running-back-texts-sumrall-an-apology-after-missouri-loss?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=baugh_apology" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Baugh Owns It: Florida Running Back Texts Sumrall an Apology After Missouri Loss</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Jadan Baugh apologized to Jon Sumrall by text the day after Florida’s 45-17 loss at Missouri, and Sumrall says his running back “owned it.”</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/baugh-owns-it-florida-running-back-texts-sumrall-an-apology-after-missouri-loss?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=baugh_apology" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Game Week</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/reeling-gamecocks-rattled-gators-homecoming-comes-with-a-fix-list?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=reeling_gamecocks" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Reeling Gamecocks, Rattled Gators: Homecoming Comes With a Fix List</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Florida’s first loss left a to-do list: block the run, stop the run, talk in the secondary. Homecoming brings a South Carolina team that is reeling even worse.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/reeling-gamecocks-rattled-gators-homecoming-comes-with-a-fix-list?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=reeling_gamecocks" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="6px 26px 0"><mj-column><mj-divider border-color="#E1E4EA" border-width="1px" padding="0 0 10px" /><mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0">MORE FROM THE SWAMP</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="8px 18px 4px">
      <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 8px 18px" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text mj-class="meta" padding="0 0 4px">Eddie Gilley</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/florida-gave-on-saturday?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=band_gilley" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 18px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Florida Gave On Saturday—Gave Way Too Much!</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 8px">Florida was beaten in every phase at Missouri. Eddie Gilley examines what went wrong and what comes next for the Gators.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/florida-gave-on-saturday?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=band_gilley" align="left" padding="0" font-size="11px" inner-padding="9px 14px">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 8px 18px" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text mj-class="meta" padding="0 0 4px">Buddy Martin</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-college-football-crisis-corn-dogs-vs-commissioners-and-why-it-s-a-big-deal?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=band_corn_dogs" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 18px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">The College Football Crisis: Corn Dogs vs Commissioners And Why It's A Big Deal!</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 8px">There are only so many weekends on the calendar and only so many hits a player’s body can take. Stretch the playoff and something has to go.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-college-football-crisis-corn-dogs-vs-commissioners-and-why-it-s-a-big-deal?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=band_corn_dogs" align="left" padding="0" font-size="11px" inner-padding="9px 14px">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 18px 4px">
      <mj-column padding="0 8px 18px" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text mj-class="meta" padding="0 0 4px">Franz Beard</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-october-6-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=band_franz_oct6" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 18px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Thoughts of the Day: October 6, 2026</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 8px">Franz Beard on whether Florida’s loss at Missouri can be a turning point, South Carolina, the SEC across the board, and the NCAA’s fifth-year fight.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-october-6-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_07&utm_content=band_franz_oct6" align="left" padding="0" font-size="11px" inner-padding="9px 14px">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FA4616" padding="20px 26px">
