        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="10px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.9px" padding="0 0 6px">LOOK AHEAD</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 0 6px"><div style="font:700 24px/1.14 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#FFFFFF;">No. 16 Florida vs. South Carolina</div></mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFF1EA" font-size="14px" padding="0">Saturday, Oct. 10 · 12:45 p.m. ET · SEC Network · Ben Hill Griffin Stadium, Homecoming. The Gators are 4-1 (2-1 SEC).</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
